<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets 400 mln Dkr five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets 400 mln Dkr five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EKSPORTFINANS</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.75 PCT  MATURITY    17.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.94    PAY DATE    17.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625 PCT SELL CONC  1.25 PCT  PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
